WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.114
Video 5. Gateway, keys, ane Go To.

00:00:04.414 --> 00:00:09.007
Aa Gateway of Hisaab chhe. Tamaru kaam ahiya
thi sharu thay chhe.

00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:15.461
Daabi baaju: chalu period, chalu taarikh,
tamari companies, ane chhello backup.

00:00:15.491 --> 00:00:21.850
Jamni baaju: menu. Arrow keys vaapro, athva
item no vaadli akshar dabavo.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:27.406
B dabavo to Balance Sheet khule chhe. Esc
tamne paachha laave chhe.

00:00:27.436 --> 00:00:35.146
Upar na bar ma Company thi Help sudhi na menus chhe.
Alt ane vaadli akshar thi darek khule chhe.

00:00:35.176 --> 00:00:38.925
Jamni baaju no button bar darek screen ni keys
batave chhe.

00:00:39.676 --> 00:00:45.991
Alt+K thi Company menu khule chhe: create,
alter, change, select ke shut.

00:00:46.021 --> 00:00:47.920
Esc thi bandh thay chhe.

00:00:49.078 --> 00:00:53.265
Alt+G etle Go To. E darek screen par chaale
chhe.

00:00:53.295 --> 00:00:59.626
Naam no ek bhaag lakho, jem ke trial. List ma
fakt mel khaatu j dekhay chhe.

00:00:59.656 --> 00:01:05.500
Enter thi Trial Balance khule chhe. Esc tamne
Gateway par paachha laave chhe.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:12.665
F2 thi chalu taarikh badlay chhe. Navi taarikh
lakho, jem ke 30-6-26.

00:01:12.695 --> 00:01:21.361
Ctrl+A thi sweekaray chhe. Have Gateway 30-Jun-2026
batave chhe. Nava vouchers aa taarikh le chhe.

00:01:22.441 --> 00:01:30.163
Alt+F3 thi Select Company khule chhe. Ema tamara
data folder ni darek company dekhay chhe.

00:01:30.193 --> 00:01:37.092
Naam no ek bhaag lakho, ane Enter dabavo.
Company pehli company ni saathe khule chhe.

00:01:37.122 --> 00:01:42.864
F3 thi chalu company badlay chhe. List ma
khulli companies dekhay chhe.

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:48.897
Ek select karo, ane Enter dabavo. Chalu
company bold akshar ma hoy chhe.

00:01:49.377 --> 00:01:56.575
Aa video ni keys: Go To maate Alt+G, taarikh
maate F2, ane company maate F3.

00:01:56.505 --> 00:02:02.813
Company select karva Alt+F3, sweekarva Ctrl+A,
ane paachha java Esc.

00:02:02.743 --> 00:02:07.144
Company menu maate Alt+K, ane line kholva
Enter.

00:02:07.344 --> 00:02:12.579
Have tame keys jaano chho. Aagal na video ma
company banavishu.

